    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41542" root="وب" body-key="w">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَبَّ</span></b>  (originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبَّ</span>, the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أ</span> being changed
into <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span>, Az,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَبٌّ</span>; and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَبَوبَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَبْوَبَةٌ</span>;
<i>He prepared to charge,</i> or <i>make an assault, in
battle.</i> (K.) See art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أب</span>.

